WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.520
2941 yen per person

00:01.930 --> 00:06.110
Glasses! Glasses! Glasses!

00:06.190 --> 00:08.730
Glasses! Glasses!

00:08.730 --> 00:10.610
Get fired up, President!

00:10.610 --> 00:11.900
Take care.

00:11.900 --> 00:13.320
Fight!

00:13.320 --> 00:14.490
I pray for your success.

00:14.910 --> 00:16.240
Good luck!

00:17.280 --> 00:18.240
Right!

00:19.370 --> 00:22.000
Glasses...

00:22.290 --> 00:25.460
Club!

01:56.010 --> 02:01.010
It's Only Natural That
Glasses Wearers Love Glasses

02:01.890 --> 02:03.390
32nd Annual
Himaraya 3rd Technical
High School
Culture Festival
Hima Fest Conference

02:02.370 --> 02:05.890
Student Council

02:04.630 --> 02:08.770
So, once again at this year's culture festival,

02:05.890 --> 02:11.910
32nd Annual
Himaraya 3rd Technical
High School
Culture Festival
Hima Fest

02:08.770 --> 02:11.910
Hima Fest, each club will be running a booth.

02:12.240 --> 02:16.150
Only one week remains before the
culture festival, so beginning today,

02:14.660 --> 02:18.650
Kendo Club            Archery Club           Judo Club           Tea Club

02:16.150 --> 02:18.660
you'll be allowed to stay extra hours
after class to make preparations.

02:18.660 --> 02:22.660
Electronics Club     Ping-Pong Club     Mountain Climbing Club     Fishing Club

02:21.270 --> 02:26.050
Now, does anyone have any questions?

02:22.660 --> 02:26.660
Glasses Club                                           Go Club

02:29.530 --> 02:32.420
No one seems to have any questions.

02:33.250 --> 02:36.910
Then, I have one proposal before we—

02:36.910 --> 02:37.760
I have an opinion!

02:37.760 --> 02:39.950
Slam!

02:38.250 --> 02:39.450
Murmur...

02:41.500 --> 02:45.520
I request an increase of culture
festival funds for our Glasses Club.

02:46.020 --> 02:48.180
Wh-Why is that?

02:48.430 --> 02:51.710
The Baseball Club gets 100,000 yen
for the culture festival,

02:51.710 --> 02:53.990
while our Glasses Club gets only 15,000.

02:54.390 --> 02:57.360
Why? Why is there such a gap?!

02:57.360 --> 02:58.650
Stomach Pain

02:58.650 --> 03:00.150
Stomach pain...

03:00.150 --> 03:02.060
W-Well...

03:02.060 --> 03:04.740
There are 34 people in the baseball club.

03:05.260 --> 03:14.290
Baseball Club

03:06.050 --> 03:09.850
If you divide their culture festival funds,
100,000 yen, by 34 people,

03:10.890 --> 03:14.190
you get 2941 yen per person.

03:14.950 --> 03:16.110
In comparison,

03:15.540 --> 03:20.720
Glasses Club

03:16.090 --> 03:20.720
the Glasses Club's culture festival funds,
15,000 yen, divided by 5 people

03:21.980 --> 03:24.970
3000 yen per person

03:22.130 --> 03:24.970
yields 3000 yen per person.
In other words,

03:25.480 --> 03:28.350
proportionally speaking,
the Glasses Club's funding is greater.

03:30.290 --> 03:31.730
one

03:30.750 --> 03:31.730
two

03:31.210 --> 03:31.730
three

03:37.480 --> 03:38.480
You're right!

03:43.220 --> 03:45.490
Now, back to business...

03:45.870 --> 03:48.040
The theme of this year's Hima Fest is

03:48.040 --> 03:51.850
"Reach to Heaven and Seize
the Future That Lies Beyond."

03:48.600 --> 03:54.630
Reach to Heaven and Seize the Future That Lies Beyond!!!

03:51.850 --> 03:54.630
Now, here is my proposal.

03:52.620 --> 03:54.630
Let's build it
together!

03:54.920 --> 03:57.000
Would all students work together...

03:58.630 --> 04:02.960
Grand Cross Blizzard Eternal SS Tower

03:59.170 --> 04:02.970
and build a "Grand Cross
Blizzard Eternal SS Tower"?

04:05.460 --> 04:06.480
Huh?

04:06.640 --> 04:09.390
Er, I said, a Grand Cro—

04:07.490 --> 04:09.730
Grand Cross Blizzard Eternal SS Tower

04:08.380 --> 04:09.730
In other words, a tower.

04:08.990 --> 04:09.730
A Tower

04:09.730 --> 04:12.730
Basketball Club          Electronics Club          Ping-Pong Club

04:09.930 --> 04:12.730
Right! I want us all to build a tower!

04:12.730 --> 04:15.100
Grand Cross Blizzard Eternal SS Tower

04:13.170 --> 04:15.100
A very tall tower!

04:16.130 --> 04:17.610
A tower?

04:17.610 --> 04:21.740
We have our own club displays to do.
We don't have time for that.

04:21.760 --> 04:23.120
Sounds like a pain.

04:26.280 --> 04:27.930
Let's build it.

04:27.930 --> 04:31.380
The Grand Cross Blizzard Eternal SS Tower.

04:36.580 --> 04:38.170
Uh, um...

04:38.660 --> 04:41.480
Well, participation in the tower's
construction will be voluntary.

04:41.480 --> 04:45.420
But this year's culture festival
will never come again.

04:46.890 --> 04:47.930
If possible...

04:48.800 --> 04:49.930
That is,

04:50.870 --> 04:53.190
I ask you all to participate.

04:58.030 --> 04:59.070
Glasses!

05:00.070 --> 05:03.140
I got 15,000 yen!

05:02.170 --> 05:03.580
15,000 yen

05:05.730 --> 05:07.210
Soma-senpai!

05:07.210 --> 05:09.160
Th-Th-That's amazing!

05:09.160 --> 05:10.950
So much money!

05:10.950 --> 05:13.330
Since our normal club fee is 500 yen...

05:17.190 --> 05:18.580
That's 20 times as much!

05:18.580 --> 05:22.090
Actually, it's 30 times.

05:20.630 --> 05:21.860
Yeah!

05:24.670 --> 05:27.970
Looking back, last year's
culture festival was a tragedy.

05:33.950 --> 05:36.460
With only three members,
our Glasses Club

05:36.460 --> 05:38.320
wasn't recognized as an official club,

05:38.320 --> 05:40.360
so we couldn't have a booth
in the culture festival.

05:49.160 --> 05:52.620
That feeling of loneliness, of failure...

05:55.230 --> 05:58.530
But it is because of the past
that we have a future.

05:58.530 --> 06:02.630
We can cherish light because
we have known darkness.

06:02.900 --> 06:04.570
To put it another way:

06:04.570 --> 06:07.890
I'm really looking forward to
this year's culture festival!

06:07.890 --> 06:13.140
Glasses
Club

06:08.140 --> 06:10.070
And with this much money,

06:10.070 --> 06:13.140
the Glasses Club's display
is sure to be a success!

06:13.380 --> 06:17.140
Right. And there'll be pretty ladies
at the culture festival, too!

06:17.320 --> 06:18.400
Yeah!

06:18.600 --> 06:21.190
There are two things that
our Glasses Club must do:

06:21.200 --> 06:25.150
create a Glasses Club display,
and complete the X-Ray Glasses!

06:25.650 --> 06:27.360
Are you up to it, everyone?

06:28.650 --> 06:33.370
Glasses!

06:45.020 --> 06:47.030
Omelet Katsu Curry

06:56.020 --> 06:58.270
Let's build it together!
The Grand Cross Blizzard Eternal SS Tower!!

06:58.430 --> 07:00.850
<i>Information from the student council:</i>

07:00.850 --> 07:04.440
<i>Today at 4:00, construction
of the tower will begin</i>

07:04.440 --> 07:06.690
<i>on the eastern area of the school grounds.</i>

07:06.690 --> 07:09.530
<i>I repeat, today at 4:00...</i>

07:14.350 --> 07:17.690
Minabe-senpai, you're stiff!
You're too stiff!

07:17.690 --> 07:19.040
It's like this!

07:19.040 --> 07:20.440
Position: Forward Bend

07:20.850 --> 07:23.040
Bendy

07:21.560 --> 07:23.040
Whoa!

07:23.300 --> 07:24.300
See?

07:25.400 --> 07:27.100
Ping!

07:27.230 --> 07:30.340
Ah...

07:33.730 --> 07:35.220
Glasses!

07:40.540 --> 07:42.320
Why isn't anyone coming?

07:42.320 --> 07:44.980
Everybody must be doing something.

07:45.370 --> 07:48.020
The door upon which you knock is steel.

07:48.020 --> 07:51.990
Sound resonates not;
nor a sigh heard within.

07:55.250 --> 07:56.250
Um...

07:57.740 --> 07:59.740
Let's wait here again tomorrow.

07:59.960 --> 08:01.250
Sir!

08:08.260 --> 08:09.510
Hima Council.

08:26.480 --> 08:30.530
X-Ray!!

08:27.560 --> 08:29.570
Today's X-Ray Glasses are...

08:30.780 --> 08:34.980
This is a special blend of herbal
tea that my brothers made.

08:35.610 --> 08:37.030
Thanks!

08:39.450 --> 08:40.540
No one's coming.

08:44.710 --> 08:49.340
I'm sure everyone's just working
on their own displays.

08:49.340 --> 08:52.300
They don't have time to help us here.

08:55.760 --> 08:57.180
I'm glad.

08:57.180 --> 09:00.100
It means they're as excited about
the culture festival as we are.

09:02.680 --> 09:04.180
Oh my God!

09:04.180 --> 09:05.940
Must be the Glasses Club again.

09:05.940 --> 09:07.810
Those guys!

09:08.980 --> 09:10.110
Toru?

09:15.450 --> 09:17.990
Glasses! Glasses!

09:18.200 --> 09:22.490
Glasses! Glasses! Glasses!

09:20.740 --> 09:22.490
Come, Glasses Wearers!
Treasure Hunt Game

09:22.700 --> 09:25.290
It's just a little explosion.
Don't let it bother you!

09:25.410 --> 09:26.500
Glasses!

09:26.870 --> 09:30.790
We still need a lot more glasses
for the treasure hunt game!

09:30.790 --> 09:32.130
Don't rest!

09:32.130 --> 09:33.260
Glasses!

09:36.430 --> 09:38.010
Hey, Glasses Club!

09:38.010 --> 09:41.430
Oh, that's what I call a glasses wearer!
You came to help us out?

09:41.600 --> 09:42.850
Thank you!

09:43.680 --> 09:46.060
O-Of course not!

09:46.060 --> 09:48.690
I-I'm with the Student Council!

09:48.850 --> 09:52.400
It doesn't matter if you're with the
Student Council or anything else.

09:52.400 --> 09:55.740
It's only natural that
glasses wearers love glasses.

09:56.950 --> 09:58.610
Glasses, glasses...

09:58.610 --> 10:01.330
Can't you think of anyone but yourselves?

10:03.080 --> 10:05.330
It's because all of our
students think like you

10:05.330 --> 10:07.830
that the president's tower
isn't making any progress.

10:08.040 --> 10:10.460
If you can't change the students
at the bottom of the ladder,

10:10.460 --> 10:12.340
you can't change the
student body as a whole!

10:12.800 --> 10:13.920
Now, come on!

10:15.380 --> 10:16.590
Not enough.

10:18.550 --> 10:19.840
Everyone, post-haste!

10:19.840 --> 10:22.010
Check the school for
glasses-making materials!

10:22.010 --> 10:24.100
Glasses!

10:28.730 --> 10:31.400
Hey, you!

10:33.820 --> 10:36.650
Uh-oh. It's the Hima Council.

10:36.650 --> 10:40.610
Let's go. If they catch us,
they'll make us work on that tower thing.

10:45.240 --> 10:48.330
I'm going to have a look inside the school.

10:54.170 --> 10:55.250
Hima Council.

10:56.420 --> 10:59.090
Yeah, we really got a lot.

11:03.390 --> 11:06.770
I guess they really can't be bothered.

11:08.060 --> 11:09.020
But...

11:09.270 --> 11:11.900
I'm counting on this year's
culture festival!

11:13.310 --> 11:17.360
Every year, people put
labels on Hima High,

11:15.270 --> 11:20.990
Stupid
(this)

11:15.770 --> 11:20.990
Idiots
(that)

11:17.360 --> 11:20.990
saying it's "this" and "that."
They've made it a laughingstock.

11:21.660 --> 11:24.870
Even though there are so many
amazing students here...

11:25.530 --> 11:29.910
Yes, if only they would come here
and see for themselves!

11:30.460 --> 11:32.420
Then, surely, they'd understand...

11:32.620 --> 11:35.380
"Hima High is great!"
"Hima High is amazing!"

11:35.380 --> 11:37.460
"I want to send my son to Hima High!"

11:37.460 --> 11:39.670
That's what they'd say!

11:39.920 --> 11:43.510
Hima High
Approval
Rating

11:39.920 --> 11:43.510
Love

11:40.260 --> 11:43.010
I want to increase Hima High's
approval rating!

11:45.550 --> 11:49.390
And I guess, to put it bluntly,

11:49.390 --> 11:52.900
I want to make everyone who ridicules
Hima High choke on their words!

11:51.440 --> 11:52.690
Choke!

11:51.600 --> 11:52.690
Intense
Slander.

11:52.900 --> 11:57.270
Because this place is the
grand stage of our youth!

11:58.280 --> 11:59.570
To achieve that,

11:59.570 --> 12:03.160
I want to do all that I can, all that I must,
as part of the student council...

12:03.780 --> 12:05.530
I want to give it all I've got!

12:07.990 --> 12:14.540
And that's why I thought up the
Grand Cross Blizzard Eternal SS Tower.

12:10.560 --> 12:14.540
Grand Cross Blizzard Eternal SS Tower

12:16.500 --> 12:19.960
But it looks like that feeling
didn't even get through

12:19.960 --> 12:22.550
to the students, let alone
the people of the town.

12:33.020 --> 12:36.440
Wow, we collected so much!

12:36.440 --> 12:39.110
We can make a lot of glasses with this.

12:44.950 --> 12:48.120
What's wrong, Soma-senpai?

12:49.330 --> 12:50.870
Let me ask you.

12:52.330 --> 12:54.710
There are no bad glasses wearers, right?

12:54.960 --> 12:56.040
Yeah!

12:56.790 --> 12:59.460
Glasses wearers are all overflowing
with chivalrous spirit, right?

12:59.460 --> 13:00.550
Of course!

12:59.460 --> 13:00.550
That's right!

12:59.460 --> 13:00.550
Yes!

13:01.130 --> 13:03.800
Glasses wearers have
passionate souls, right?

13:03.800 --> 13:05.300
Of course!

13:05.300 --> 13:06.680
Okay, it's decided!

13:06.680 --> 13:09.430
The Glasses Club will put
on one more display!

13:09.680 --> 13:10.680
Right!

13:12.180 --> 13:13.560
Wait.

13:12.430 --> 13:13.560
Wait

13:13.560 --> 13:15.440
HUH?!

13:15.440 --> 13:17.190
No! No! Not possible!

13:17.190 --> 13:20.860
Just doing our club display and the
X-Ray Glasses is a hard enough schedule!

13:20.860 --> 13:22.690
You can't add in one more thing!

13:23.190 --> 13:25.700
The culture festival is just two days away.

13:25.700 --> 13:26.780
Yeah.

13:28.200 --> 13:31.330
Man

13:29.370 --> 13:34.830
Every man has one grand thing
he must do once in his life.

13:34.830 --> 13:39.540
I want to share that once-in-a-lifetime
thing with all of you!

13:58.980 --> 14:00.560
Takuma, all yours.

14:01.480 --> 14:02.900
They're...

14:02.900 --> 14:05.610
doing their own thing again!

14:06.360 --> 14:07.660
Glasses Club!

14:16.080 --> 14:16.910
Will.

14:22.250 --> 14:24.420
The Glasses Club members?

14:27.840 --> 14:29.260
Could it be?

14:29.260 --> 14:31.300
Glasses Club!

14:32.510 --> 14:33.560
Stomach Pain

14:33.560 --> 14:34.930
Stomach pain...

14:36.100 --> 14:39.770
T-Toru, why do you always...

14:39.770 --> 14:41.650
Suzuki wears glasses, too.

14:42.150 --> 14:45.150
He must have complicated feelings
about the Glasses Club.

14:45.610 --> 14:47.400
Stomach pain...

14:48.740 --> 14:51.370
Okay, calm down, 3rd and the other guys.

14:51.240 --> 14:52.660
The other guys?

14:51.370 --> 14:52.660
Don't call me 3rd!

14:52.830 --> 14:55.910
I think we should have a contest.

14:55.910 --> 14:59.000
A fair and even challenge between
the Hima Council and the Glasses Club.

14:59.670 --> 15:01.080
What are you planning?

15:02.460 --> 15:06.920
Light Speed Look-That-Way

15:04.880 --> 15:06.920
Leave the judging to me!

15:08.130 --> 15:14.180
Only those possessed of true courage
and potential may ascend to this stage.

15:14.810 --> 15:19.600
Lamentable challengers,
can you stop my neck and fingers?

15:19.600 --> 15:22.440
Huh?! You're going? Not me?

15:23.610 --> 15:24.770
Accepted.

15:31.570 --> 15:34.700
You two! That's some hot passion!

15:41.080 --> 15:42.710
Rock, paper...

15:42.710 --> 15:43.920
Scissors!

15:47.460 --> 15:49.340
Look...

15:50.050 --> 15:52.050
That way! That way! That way! That way!

15:54.010 --> 15:56.560
Roarrrr

15:58.390 --> 16:01.600
At that size, it must be...

16:10.440 --> 16:14.740
I underestimated it.
Light Speed Look-That-Way...

16:17.080 --> 16:19.870
Okay, that worked up a good sweat.
Let's go home!

16:19.870 --> 16:20.890
Yeah!

16:20.890 --> 16:21.500
What?

16:21.500 --> 16:23.500
You're not gonna build that thing?

16:21.500 --> 16:23.500
Glasses
Club

16:24.580 --> 16:26.460
It's practically complete.

16:26.460 --> 16:27.880
Wh-When did that happen?!

16:28.250 --> 16:30.170
Think back.

16:37.680 --> 16:41.600
Oh no! I got so wrapped up
in Look-That-Way...

16:42.560 --> 16:44.730
All that's left is to wait for tomorrow!

16:49.150 --> 16:50.940
The Glasses Club is truly foolish!

16:50.940 --> 17:00.870
Glasses
Club

16:51.400 --> 16:53.320
Let's take it down now.

16:55.110 --> 16:58.240
Is that unambiguously your intention?

16:58.240 --> 17:00.540
Going that far is a "No, thank you."

17:01.290 --> 17:03.210
Then I'll do it myself!

17:06.670 --> 17:08.000
Y-You wanna fight?!

17:08.000 --> 17:11.630
There it is! I almost forgot!

17:11.840 --> 17:15.340
I hope President Sato is happy.

17:16.300 --> 17:17.640
What do you mean?

17:19.220 --> 17:23.270
I don't know exactly, but I know
Soma-kun started building this

17:23.270 --> 17:28.190
because he heard President Sato's wish
to make Hima High even better.

17:29.610 --> 17:31.480
What is this thing?

17:31.480 --> 17:34.570
Huh? This? This is...

17:34.570 --> 17:36.200
I'm not really sure.

17:35.530 --> 17:36.200
Slump

17:36.610 --> 17:39.620
You made this without understanding?

17:39.620 --> 17:42.490
You Glasses Club members
always do things like this!

17:42.490 --> 17:44.710
Do you feel no concern
for your own minds?

17:44.830 --> 17:46.580
Never!

17:46.580 --> 17:51.960
Because everything Soma-kun does
is always amazing and wonderful.

17:52.630 --> 17:56.300
I think that it's not so
important what you make,

17:56.300 --> 17:59.850
but who you make it with, and how.

18:02.140 --> 18:03.770
So long!

18:03.770 --> 18:06.230
See you tomorrow at the culture festival!

18:06.520 --> 18:09.650
One for all, all for one.

18:09.650 --> 18:12.980
Everything we do is for the
Student Council President! Right?

18:13.280 --> 18:17.610
Everyone in the Glasses Club are
very good boys, aren't they?

18:17.610 --> 18:22.620
Yes. They seem to be
kindred spirits to us, indeed.

18:24.240 --> 18:27.410
It's probably something so stupid,
it's not worth destroying, anyway.

18:34.510 --> 18:35.510
Stare.

18:36.880 --> 18:39.720
What's wrong, President? Can I help you?

18:40.640 --> 18:42.350
L-Listen, Soma-kun.

18:42.850 --> 18:47.640
I know this is abrupt,
but that thing on the field...

18:47.810 --> 18:49.850
Let's build it together!
The Grand Cross Blizzard Eternal SS Tower!!

18:48.560 --> 18:49.850
it's this, right?

18:50.100 --> 18:51.360
Yeah, that's right.

18:52.860 --> 18:55.690
Yeah, yeah! I knew it! Of course!

18:55.690 --> 18:57.650
I thought that's what it must be!

18:58.030 --> 19:00.490
Oh, sorry to take up your time.

19:00.490 --> 19:02.370
Well, see you tomorrow.

19:11.920 --> 19:15.500
<i>The exceptionally powerful Typhoon #9</i>

19:15.500 --> 19:19.090
<i>is causing significant damage
in all regions of Japan.</i>

19:19.090 --> 19:21.260
<i>The Meteorological Agency
predicts heavy rain and...</i>

19:44.830 --> 19:45.910
Let's go.

19:49.660 --> 19:52.120
<i>The typhoon should pass
by early morning,</i>

19:52.120 --> 19:54.380
<i>bringing clear skies tomorrow.</i>

19:55.170 --> 19:57.590
It sounds like the culture
festival will be fine.

20:06.850 --> 20:09.140
Don't let your guard down!
It'll get blown away!

20:09.140 --> 20:10.180
Right!

20:10.180 --> 20:13.440
Okay! Fasten it to that fence!

20:16.070 --> 20:16.860
Oh, no!

20:20.780 --> 20:22.070
We'll help!

20:24.370 --> 20:25.450
President!

20:25.450 --> 20:27.120
Vice President!

20:27.120 --> 20:30.160
President! Bring the rope to my hand!

20:30.160 --> 20:33.120
Hey, c'mon! Pull it hard!

20:33.790 --> 20:34.830
Takahashi...

20:34.830 --> 20:36.130
Tony!

20:39.210 --> 20:41.010
Thanks, President!

20:41.220 --> 20:42.260
Right!

21:08.910 --> 21:09.990
Okay!

21:10.540 --> 21:12.960
Just hold out until
tomorrow morning, okay?

21:12.960 --> 21:16.290
After all we did, of course it'll hold!

21:16.290 --> 21:20.210
But if you're that worried,
you could stay here and keep watch!

23:11.950 --> 23:13.330
We made it through the storm!

23:13.330 --> 23:14.990
And the Hima Fest begins at last.

23:14.990 --> 23:16.660
Does youth seen through glasses

23:16.660 --> 23:19.370
shine brighter than the
blue sky after a typhoon?

23:19.370 --> 23:21.290
Next time: Episode 12 of "Glasses Club."

23:21.290 --> 23:23.960
This is the first time we've done
something like a real preview!

23:23.960 --> 23:25.800
No glasses, no life!

